# Session documents — the working notes a Claude Code session writes and reads.
# They are how a session hands off to the next one, not part of the app, and
# they date fast; the format contracts they describe live in ASSIGNMENT_MD_SPEC.md
# and CLAUDE.md, which are tracked. Keep them local.
HANDOFF_*.md
COMPLETION_*.md
WORKORDER_*.md
CORRECTION_*.md
REPORT_*.md

# Internal specs — the handwritten-regions spec versions. Excluded because they
# describe campus infrastructure and compliance topology (the P2/P3 trust zones,
# the on-campus node, the identifier screen, the Attachment A and B controls),
# which belong to the UC Davis filing and not to a public repository. The folder
# also carries its own .gitignore, so the exclusion survives an edit here.
specs-internal/
